{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな元気カナ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな～＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！タイトルはこの私です。\nおじさんごめんなさい〇┓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の記事の…\n考えてくださって\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cherry.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良いのいっぱいあったから\n検討中です｀・ω・´"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ募集してるんで\n思いついたら是非！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！\n昨日の乃木どこの話です＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※ネタバレ嫌だったら\nこの先はまた今度読んでください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！\n見た方はわかると思いますが\n初公開の髪型をしてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cherry.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好評が多くて高まったぁぁぁあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/28/0001.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとダンス！\nめちゃくちゃ緊張しましたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/shock.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「まだ公演など何もやってない乃木坂を代表してダンスを見せる」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"極度のプレッシャーそれなヽ(；；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも選んでいただけて\n嬉しかったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( ゜_ゝ゜)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子のファンってどう思う？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nそんなの…\n嬉しいに決まってるじゃないかぁぁぁあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そもそも中田は女ヲタですよ！←\n親近感沸いちゃいますね＼^^／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？沸く？\n沸いてきたぁぁぁあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいま！家着いた＼^^／\n今日はイベの練習したよ～\nあら\nもうこんな時間だ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい(-ω∩).zZ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}